@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://cmt#Chairman> rdfs:subClassOf <http://conference#Track-workshop_chair> .

<http://cmt#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceChair> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ExternalReviewer> rdfs:subClassOf <http://conference#Reviewer> .

<http://cmt#Meta-Reviewer> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Reviewer> .

<http://cmt#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Paper> .

<http://cmt#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Person> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommittee> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Program_committee> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommitteeChair> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Program_committee> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Program_committee> .

<http://cmt#Review> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Review> .

<http://cmt#Reviewer> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Reviewer> .

<http://cmt#endReview> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#Review> .

<http://cmt#hasAuthor> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#has_authors> .

<http://cmt#hasCo-author> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#has_authors> .

<http://cmt#hasProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#has_a_program_committee> .

<http://cmt#memberOfProgramCommittee> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#Program_committee> .

<http://cmt#paperID> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#Paper> .

